          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/kamalraj21" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-[#007CC7] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#007CC7] rounded transition-colors">GitHub</a>
